command-description-mark-set =
    Set the value of $marked to the input uid(s). There is no "get" version of this command, as the return value of $marked would be whatever you pass into this.
command-description-mark-append = Append input uid(s) to $marked.
command-description-mark-appendget = Append input uid(s) to $marked and return $marked.
command-description-mark-rm = Remove input uid(s) from $marked.
command-description-mark-rmget = Remove input uid(s) from $marked and return $marked.
command-description-mark-clear = Clears the value of $marked.
